{"id": "68537", "title": "闪婚少校娇妻", "author": "心静如水", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 56, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68537.htm", "intro": "陆军某集团军最年轻的少校乔东城要相亲了，圈子里风声一爆出，你看众家美女群芳争艳吧。\r\n第一个，第二个，第三个，第四个……天呀，\r\n现在的女人都是怎么了，难道不知道结婚要到法定年龄吗，\r\n眼前这女生，高中毕业了吗？ 对不起，大叔，我刚好二十二可以领结婚证了。\r\n好，如果婚后一年三百六十五天，你可能有三百天要独自生活有意见吗？\r\n真的吗，那太好了，我就想要这样的生活。\r\n如果婚后每个月只给你二千块家用，满意吗？\r\n每个月还有家用，太好了。\r\n好吧，就你了，于是，订婚都省了，你填份表格，\r\n然后去做个婚前检查，下周三民政局门口见。\r\n于是，红本拿到手了，新郎出任务走了，新娘自由了……\r\n还有什么比这更好滴生活哇，太阳当空照，花儿对我笑……。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68537", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10534770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10534771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10534772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10534773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10534774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10534775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-62", "file": "10534776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "63-64", "file": "10534777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "65-67", "file": "10534778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "68-69", "file": "10534779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "70-71", "file": "10534780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "72-74", "file": "10534781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75-76", "file": "10534782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-78", "file": "10534783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "79-80", "file": "10534784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-84", "file": "10534785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "85-86", "file": "10534786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "87-88", "file": "10534787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "89", "file": "10534788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90-91", "file": "10534789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "92-93", "file": "10534790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-95", "file": "10534791.html", "available